TI  - Changes and machine learning-based prediction in quality characteristics of sliced Korean cabbage (Brassica rapa L. pekinensis) kimchi: Combined effect of nano-foamed structure film packaging and subcooled storage
T2  - LWT-FOOD SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY
