TI  - Optimizing the thermal assisted high-pressure process parameters for a sugarcane based mixed beverage using response surface methodology
T2  - JOURNAL OF FOOD PROCESS ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - HIGH HYDROSTATIC-PRESSURE
KW  - JUICE
KW  - COLOR
