TI  - EFFECT OF PASTEURIZATION TEMPERATURE ON STABILITY OF AN ACIDIFIED SUGARCANE JUICE BEVERAGE
T2  - CIENCIA E AGROTECNOLOGIA
LA  - English
KW  - Shelf-life
KW  - hurdle technology
KW  - aseptic filling
