TI  - Optimization of a multi-metal-coordinated in-situ saccharification system for biohydrogen production via liquid neural network-bayesian optimization: Coupling artificial intelligence with microbial community succession and predicted functions
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL CHEMICAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
