TI  - Online measurement of carambola (Averrhoa carambola L.) physicochemical properties and estimation of maturity stages using a portable NIR spectrometer
T2  - SCIENTIA HORTICULTURAE
LA  - English
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - Star fruit
